# Release notes

This release makes the **parser** faster and the *errors* clearer.
It also fixes `a < b` in templates; see [the guide](https://example.org/guide?a=1&b=2).

## What changed

- Lists of **bold** and *slanted* items
- A literal `**` stays as written
- An unclosed * star stays too

1. Download the archive
2. Run `make install`
3. Done

> Upgrading is safe.
> Keep a **backup** all the same.

```sh
tar xf release.tar.gz
./configure --prefix="$HOME/.local" && make
```

---

Questions go to <support@example.org> & the forum.
